  "shortDescription": {
    "en": "OMNIS opens when programmer Albert Weiss detects a distributed pattern in Lineara, a one-dimensional artificial universe. What looks like wasted electricity becomes communication from a consciousness that has spent millennia asking whether time continues outside its world. Albert and neuroinformatician Camila Varga build a timing language, but recognition immediately creates obligations their laboratory never designed.",
